      hu: ["A terminált eredetileg az 1880-as években alapították.", "2008 óta a kazah állami KazMunayGas vállalat tulajdonában van.", "Az éves átrakodási kapacitás körülbelül 12-15 millió tonna.", "A létesítmény közvetlenül kapcsolódik a grúz vasúthálózathoz.", "A terminál 5 horgonyzóhellyel rendelkezik a batumi kikötőben.", "A tartálypark teljes tárolókapacitása mintegy 600 000 köbméter."],
      ro: ["Terminalul a fost fondat inițial în anii 1880.", "Din 2008, este deținut de compania de stat kazahă KazMunayGas.", "Capacitatea anuală de tranzit este de aproximativ 12-15 milioane de tone.", "Este conectat la rețeaua feroviară georgiană pentru transportul petrolului.", "Terminalul dispune de 5 dane de acostare în portul Batumi.", "Capacitatea de stocare a facilității este de circa 600.000 metri cubi."],
      en: ["The terminal was originally established in the 1880s.", "It has been owned by the Kazakh state company KazMunayGas since 2008.", "The annual throughput capacity is approximately 12-15 million tons.", "The facility is integrated with the Georgian railway network for oil transit.", "The terminal operates 5 berths within the Port of Batumi.", "The total storage capacity of the facility is around 600,000 cubic meters."],
